WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.496
You can't tell which one is real.

00:00:03.496 --> 00:00:06.144
Don't overthink it. Is it me? Or is it her?

00:00:06.144 --> 00:00:06.780
It's me.

00:00:07.080 --> 00:00:08.844
Introducing Avatar 6,

00:00:08.844 --> 00:00:11.364
the best avatar model in the world.

00:00:11.364 --> 00:00:13.380
In a Turing test, 84% of people

00:00:13.380 --> 00:00:16.258
couldn't tell Avatar 6 from the real person.

00:00:16.258 --> 00:00:19.280
This is how you show up on the first take every time.

00:00:19.460 --> 00:00:20.580
Here's what changed.

00:00:20.580 --> 00:00:22.672
First, we raised the bar on realism again.

00:00:22.672 --> 00:00:24.240
You're looking at it.

00:00:24.240 --> 00:00:25.626
Second, gestures.

00:00:25.626 --> 00:00:28.214
Your number one complaint about Avatar 5

00:00:28.214 --> 00:00:30.340
was the repetitive motion,

00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:31.818
so we fixed it.

00:00:31.818 --> 00:00:34.183
Now Avatar 6 understands your script

00:00:34.183 --> 00:00:35.760
and matches your emotions,

00:00:36.200 --> 00:00:39.003
gestures, and expressions to what you actually mean.

00:00:39.003 --> 00:00:41.712
Third, it trains on more of you.

00:00:41.712 --> 00:00:43.020
Avatar 6 learns

00:00:43.020 --> 00:00:44.950
from up to 30 seconds of video and a photo

00:00:44.950 --> 00:00:47.920
to create your most realistic personal avatar.

00:00:48.560 --> 00:00:51.729
Now you can be anywhere, ready for any scene.

00:00:51.729 --> 00:00:52.500
Watch this.

00:00:52.500 --> 00:00:54.980
We did it! Best day ever!

00:00:54.980 --> 00:00:56.840
Can I tell you a secret?

00:00:57.980 --> 00:00:59.514
That's actually funny.

00:00:59.514 --> 00:01:01.560
I told you this yesterday!

00:01:02.120 --> 00:01:03.677
Wait, you're already here?

00:01:03.677 --> 00:01:06.300
That's what it means to get you right the first time.

00:01:06.880 --> 00:01:08.460
Avatar 6, try it now.
